{
  "_note": [
    "Where each provider's prices can be checked, and how much that check is worth.",
    "",
    "kind: 'first-party' — the provider IS the model vendor, so OpenRouter's",
    "catalogue reflects that vendor's own published rate and can be diffed",
    "automatically. Verified against five hand-checked rates on 2026-08-08 with",
    "an exact match on all five.",
    "",
    "kind: 'third-party-host' — the provider RESELLS someone else's open model",
    "at its own rate. OpenRouter's number is a different host's price and says",
    "nothing about this one, so these need a human on the vendor's pricing page.",
    "The tool tracks how stale each check is rather than pretending to verify it.",
    "",
    "kind: 'free-tier' — no published per-token rate. Recorded spend will be $0,",
    "which means a budget cap on these can never trip. Treat with suspicion."
  ],
  "tolerancePct": 1,
  "maxAgeDays": 90,
